{
  "description": "The shared fixture of the Journal's list. `lines` are the items of `GET /v1/journal` as the service builds them (journal.schema.json `item`), `projects` the multi-night plans they point at (a plan with `status: \"finished\"` makes a group). Each case gives a `query` and what the list must answer: for every page of the query (`limit` 50 when absent) the `lineIds` in order (a line's `sessionId`, else its `planId`), the `groups` that page draws (the finished plan, the ids of every matching session of it, its acquired seconds), whether another page follows (`hasNext`), and over the whole selection `years`, `instruments` and `stats`. The cursor is opaque and implementation-defined: a replay follows the cursor each page gives. Hand-written; `packages/astro-contracts/tests/journal-reference.mjs` is the reference reading the contract test checks it against.",
